{
  "name": "poolrooms",

  "_comment": [
    "The whole environment, as data. Geometry comes from the app-registered",
    "'poolroom' composite generator (poolroom_generator.hpp), which also emits",
    "the water surface, the porthole lamps, the player spawn and the ladder /",
    "skylight markers as child entities. Textures are baked by Vapor::proctex",
    "at parse time and referenced from material slots as '@name'.",
    "",
    "To use a real photograph instead of a placeholder, replace the '@name'",
    "with a path: \"albedoMap\": \"textures/poolrooms/deck_tile_albedo.png\".",
    "Geometry and UVs are authored so a single-tile texture maps one tile per",
    "cell."
  ],

  "textures": [
    { "name": "deckAlbedo",    "generator": "tileAlbedo",    "params": { "base": [0.78, 0.76, 0.73], "rimTint": [0.86, 0.86, 0.86], "seed": 11 } },
